{"5378470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Don't Drink","steam_appid":5378470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperfocused on your boxing era, you and your friend blackout after drinking too many energy drinks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in an unknown place, who knows how many years after, and look for him while:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning new skills<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making new friends<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your fishing journal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorating your own hub<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letting coin tosses (literally) decide your luck!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/extras\/36f190eedd989ac7070c56fc1b7e264c.apng?t=1793666357\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/extras\/36f190eedd989ac7070c56fc1b7e264c.poster.avif?t=1793666357\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Contains a bit of dark humour, not intended to harm anyone]<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements soon to be implemented.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperfocused on your boxing era, you and your friend blackout after drinking too many energy drinks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in an unknown place, who knows how many years after, and look for him while:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning new skills<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making new friends<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your fishing journal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorating your own hub<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letting coin tosses (literally) decide your luck!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/extras\/36f190eedd989ac7070c56fc1b7e264c.apng?t=1793666357\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/extras\/36f190eedd989ac7070c56fc1b7e264c.poster.avif?t=1793666357\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Contains a bit of dark humour, not intended to harm anyone]<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements soon to be implemented.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A strange night. A questionable decision. And a can you probably shouldn't have opened. Don't Drink offers a small but charismatic world with RPG elements and 'interesting' foes.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/4b686fbe0acfbb5fc40bf29e068260c6a3878de6\/header.jpg?t=1793666357","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/960dc630e0d0be2b8f210ba4d60803301e393beb\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793666357","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5378470\/960dc630e0d0be2b8f210ba4d60803301e393beb\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793666357","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo \/ AMD equivalent<br><\/li>